Every action is validated on the clone before it is kept: forward and
self references, operator and literal fit, stale option codes, new
cycles, validation fit, move order, type changes that break dependents
(errors, with a corrected action when one is safe); dangling pipes and
contradictions (warnings). Renames go through applyRename so references
follow. The parser gains NOR, did-you-mean, strict numeric literals, ISO
dates, and canonicalisation of structured conditions keyed by code.

The dependency index knows the analysis plan, constructs and
translations; impactOf/impactOfAction compute what a change reaches with
a severity and a summary, carried on each result; changeItems gives the
per-change records the new review will render; diffSurveys reports moves.

Engine 1540 tests (1439 before); 196 mutations, survivors closed with 49
tests or documented as equivalent; 3 real bugs found and fixed.

